'''Clifton'''  is a neighborhood on the [[North Shore, Staten Island|North Shore]] of [[Staten Island]] in [[New York City]], United States. It is an older waterfront neighborhood, facing [[Upper New York Bay]] on the east. It is bordered on the north by [[Stapleton, Staten Island|Stapleton]], on the south by [[Rosebank, Staten Island|Rosebank]], on the southwest by [[Concord, Staten Island|Concord]], and on the west by Van Duzer Street.
